 	u32 status = 0;
 
+	/*
+	 * Beam-gate EVERY arm (wedge fix 2026-07-18). Before, only the arm from the
+	 * vblank IRQ checked the beam; the hrtimer ones (retries) ran in
+	 * open loop at line_total*ns_per_line per hop (truncated ns,
+	 * CLOCK_MONOTONIC vs the PLL's real dotclock) and, since vblank_quirk
+	 * skipped the arm with the timer active, under sustained commits at
