- * on top of this foundation.
+ * The "de_top" control registers (RT_EN, OUT_SIZE, AUTO_CLK, DE2TCON_MUX, the
+ * RCQ head pointer and RCQ_CTL itself) are plain MMIO and latch directly.
  */
 
